/P 54 0 R
/T (Shell scripts can be quickest for one server and one simple task. For 20 servers, Ansible inventories and reusable idempotent playbooks reduce configuration drift and repeated manual work. Shell scripts require custom SSH loops, error handling and rollback; Ansible requires learning YAML, inventories, roles and privilege escalation. For a single host, either may be similar in setup time; for many hosts, reusable Ansible automation is usually easier to keep consistent.)
/E (Shell scripts can be quickest for one server and one simple task. For 20 servers, Ansible inventories and reusable idempotent playbooks reduce configuration drift and repeated manual work. Shell scripts require custom SSH loops, error handling and rollback; Ansible requires learning YAML, inventories, roles and privilege escalation. For a single host, either may be similar in setup time; for many hosts, reusable Ansible automation is usually easier to keep consistent.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
