/T (Fixed VMs sized for peak can serve immediately if already running, but remain idle during most of the year and cost money. Kubernetes can scale down off-peak and add replicas during demand, but metrics, scheduling, image pulls and startup create delay. Since result day is predictable, schedule pre-scaling before the event and retain warm baseline replicas.)
/E (Fixed VMs sized for peak can serve immediately if already running, but remain idle during most of the year and cost money. Kubernetes can scale down off-peak and add replicas during demand, but metrics, scheduling, image pulls and startup create delay. Since result day is predictable, schedule pre-scaling before the event and retain warm baseline replicas.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [24]
>>
