/T (A Pod is the smallest deployable unit. A Deployment maintains desired replicas and replaces failed Pods. A Service gives stable discovery and load balancing. Resource requests guide scheduling; limits cap CPU/memory consumption. HPA adjusts replica count from CPU, memory or custom metrics. Readiness probes keep unready Pods out of service; liveness probes can restart unhealthy containers. Spread replicas across nodes/zones.)
/E (A Pod is the smallest deployable unit. A Deployment maintains desired replicas and replaces failed Pods. A Service gives stable discovery and load balancing. Resource requests guide scheduling; limits cap CPU/memory consumption. HPA adjusts replica count from CPU, memory or custom metrics. Readiness probes keep unready Pods out of service; liveness probes can restart unhealthy containers. Spread replicas across nodes/zones.)
