<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 59 0 R
/T (Compose can run multiple replicas on one Docker host and is simple for small deployments. It does not by itself schedule across several nodes or provide cluster-level recovery if the host fails. Kubernetes schedules across nodes, replaces failed Pods, supports stable services and HPA, but needs more operational skills and cluster resources.)
/E (Compose can run multiple replicas on one Docker host and is simple for small deployments. It does not by itself schedule across several nodes or provide cluster-level recovery if the host fails. Kubernetes schedules across nodes, replaces failed Pods, supports stable services and HPA, but needs more operational skills and cluster resources.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
