/Title (Create separate accounts: portal \(non-login service account\), deploy \(restricted deployment\), dba \(database administration\) and named administrators. Use groups portal-app, portal-ops and db-admin. Grant only required permissions. Run Gunicorn through systemd with a dedicated working directory, Restart=on-failure and restricted privileges. Monitor application errors, latency, service restarts, CPU, memory, disk and database health. Retain logs and forward them centrally when multiple servers are used.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 618 0 R
>>
endobj
678 0 obj
<<
/Title (Assign private static addresses to application/database nodes and a public load-balancer address for users. Configure DNS such as results.example.edu. Nginx terminates TLS and proxies to the app on a private interface. Firewall: allow TCP 80/443 from users; allow SSH 22 only from the administration VPN/IP range; deny other inbound traffic. Allow database port 5432 only from application nodes. Use SSH keys, disable password login and direct root login, and patch regularly.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 619 0 R
>>
endobj
