/Title (Compose can run multiple replicas on one Docker host and is simple for small deployments. It does not by itself schedule across several nodes or provide cluster-level recovery if the host fails. Kubernetes schedules across nodes, replaces failed Pods, supports stable services and HPA, but needs more operational skills and cluster resources.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 623 0 R
>>
