/Title (Automate database backups and restore verification, log rotation, disk alerts, certificate-expiry checks, service health checks and security updates during a maintenance window. Use cron for simple recurring tasks or systemd timers for service-aware jobs. Hourly cron example: `0 * * * * /opt/ops/log_summary.sh >> /var/log/portal-summary.log 2>&1`.)
